clause.content:
by striking “(A) Ferry boat systems.—” and all that follows through “(i) Fiscal years 2006 through 2010.—$10,000,000 shall be available in each of fiscal years 2006 through 2010” and inserting the following:

                                “(A) Ferry boat systems. $10,000,000 shall be available in each of fiscal years 2006 through 2011”
                            ;

by adding after clause (v) the following:

                                “(vi) $13,500,000 for fiscal year 2011.”
                            ;
